      "role": "model",
      "text": "Hi, I'm Mike. Thanks for joining. This is a practice interview with 5 main questions. Take your time with each answer. Let's start. Describe the piece of work from the last two years that you are most proud of.",
      "kind": "question",
      "question_id": "B1"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Second version: I built a pricing experiment that lifted revenue by ten percent.",
      "question_id": "B1",
      "kind": "main"
    },
    {
      "role": "model",
      "text": "Okay. Describe a time you had to explain a complex idea to someone non-technical.",
      "kind": "question",
      "question_id": "C2"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Answer two v2: explained the data model with a simple analogy.",
      "question_id": "C2",
      "kind": "main"
    },
    {
      "role": "model",
      "text": "Okay. Describe a time you pushed back on a stakeholder's request.",
      "kind": "question",
      "question_id": "D2"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Our sales lead asked me to add a custom report for one client. I pushed back because it would delay the core roadmap, showed the data on how few users needed it, and proposed an export instead. We agreed, and the client was satisfied with the export in the end.",
      "question_id": "D2",
      "kind": "main"
    },
    {
      "role": "model",
      "text": "Okay. Describe a time requirements changed in the middle of your work.",
      "kind": "question",
      "question_id": "E5"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "We changed the plan and it was fine.",
      "question_id": "E5",
      "kind": "main"
    },
    {
      "role": "model",
      "text": "What was the first thing you did when you heard?",
      "kind": "follow_up",
      "question_id": "E5"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I called the team together and we re-ranked the backlog in an hour.",
      "question_id": "E5",
      "kind": "follow_up"
    },
    {
      "role": "model",
      "text": "What would you ask earlier next time to avoid the surprise?",
      "kind": "follow_up",
      "question_id": "E5"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Next time I would ask stakeholders about open assumptions during kickoff.",
      "question_id": "E5",
      "kind": "follow_up"
    },
    {
      "role": "model",
      "text": "Okay. Tell me about a project that did not go as planned.",
      "kind": "question",
      "question_id": "F1"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Our launch slipped by a month because of a vendor; I re-planned and communicated weekly.",
